WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:04.770
<i>Wealth, fame, power...</i>

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.670
<i>Gold Roger,
the King of the Pirates,</i>

00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.970
<i>attained everything
this world has to offer.</i>

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.840
<i>The words he uttered just before
his death drove people to the seas.</i>

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.680
<i>My treasure? If you want it,
you can have it!</i>

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:20.240
<i>Find it! I left everything
this world has to offer there!</i>

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:27.590
<i>And so men head for the Grand Line
in pursuit of their dreams!</i>

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:31.490
<i>The world has truly entered
a Great Pirate Era!</i>

00:00:31.490 --> 00:00:36.860
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:42.770
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:44.100
<i>ONE PIECE!</i>

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.620
<i>Compasses only cause delays</i>

00:00:54.620 --> 00:01:00.350
<i>Delirious with fever,
I take the helm</i>

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:10.350
<i>If the dusty treasure map has
been verified, it's not a legend!</i>

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:18.170
<i>When it comes to personal storms,</i>

00:01:18.170 --> 00:01:23.480
<i>simply ride aboard
someone else's biorhythm</i>

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:27.150
<i>and pretend it isn't there!</i>

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:32.650
<i>We're going to gather up
all our dreams</i>

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:38.360
<i>and set out in search
of something to find</i>

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:44.600
<i>A coin in my pocket,
and do you wanna be my friend?</i>

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:49.970
<i>We are, We are on the cruise!</i>

00:01:49.970 --> 00:01:51.040
<i>We are!</i>

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:54.910
--Jango!
--Y-yeah?

00:01:54.910 --> 00:02:01.520
I'll handle the boy.
You take care of Miss Kaya.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.750
As we planned, have her write a will...

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.080
...then kill her!

00:02:12.990 --> 00:02:19.300
U- Usopp Pirates!

00:02:19.300 --> 00:02:21.270
Protect Kaya!

00:02:21.270 --> 00:02:23.440
Luffy!

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:26.840
Me and Usopp are gonna chase
that hypno-freak! That a problem?!

00:02:26.840 --> 00:02:28.500
Nope! Hurry!

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:34.010
What?!

00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:41.420
T-that's Captain Kuro for ya!

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:43.520
--Get 'im!
--Hurray for Captain Kuro!

00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:46.560
--Captain Kuro!
--You're awesome, Captain Kuro!

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:50.060
Don't call me that name!

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:54.570
This plan is so I can be completely
rid of the name "Captain Kuro!"

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:56.740
I'm tired...

00:02:56.740 --> 00:03:02.880
Devising plans everyday for you
men who only care about mayhem...

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:08.580
Being relentlessly attacked by
government dogs and bounty hunters...

00:03:14.160 --> 00:03:16.150
W-what?!

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.960
You're "tired?!"

00:03:23.960 --> 00:03:28.990
You're not fit to be a pirate if having
a name on the seas scares you!

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:36.840
My ambition is much greater than yours!

00:03:39.850 --> 00:03:44.510
<i>"Protect Kaya! The Usopp Pirates'
Great Efforts!"</i>

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:57.630
Is that hypnotist still behind us?!

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:01.070
Nope, I don't see him!
Let's lose him for good!

00:04:01.070 --> 00:04:05.140
Like he can really catch
us inside this forest!

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:09.110
<i>Don't worry, Kaya-san!
We will keep you safe!</i>

00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:12.440
Yeah! In the name
of the Usopp Pirates!

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.510
Thank you...

00:04:42.110 --> 00:04:43.870
Not there...

00:04:44.880 --> 00:04:47.680
Where are you, you runts?!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:50.340
Don't think you can escape me!

00:04:53.690 --> 00:04:58.630
I can shave this whole
forest bald, if you'd like!

00:04:58.630 --> 00:05:01.960
<i>Whoa! He seems really mad!</i>

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:05.300
He's not just a hypnotist?!

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.870
Where did you run off to?

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.070
This way!

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:34.480
Where are you, you runts?!

00:05:35.630 --> 00:05:39.500
Hey! East! East! I said east!

00:05:39.500 --> 00:05:41.700
Like I know where that is!
Tell me left or right!

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.800
--Then turn right!
--That's the opposite way!

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:49.500
<i>Kaya-san!</i>

00:05:51.610 --> 00:05:55.220
I'm sorry... You run on ahead...

00:05:55.220 --> 00:06:00.790
<i>What are you saying?!
Our mission is to protect you!</i>

00:06:00.790 --> 00:06:02.760
Oh no! She's got a really bad fever!

00:06:02.760 --> 00:06:04.690
<i>Eh?! Hang in there, Kaya-san!</i>

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:05.890
A doctor! Get a doctor!

00:06:05.890 --> 00:06:10.500
You idiot! This is no time for that!
Someone's trying to kill her!

00:06:10.500 --> 00:06:12.870
But it's dangerous for
her to run any more!

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:14.240
But...

00:06:14.240 --> 00:06:16.900
Where are you, you runts?!

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:28.250
Thank you...
I'm happy that you helped me...

00:06:28.250 --> 00:06:30.890
Just the thought is enough for me...

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.980
Run away, all three of you.

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:36.760
Where did you run off to?

00:06:36.760 --> 00:06:40.720
It's no use running! Come on out!

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:49.600
<i>If we leave Kaya-san and run now,
we'll probably survive, right?</i>

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.840
Yeah, probably.

00:06:51.840 --> 00:06:55.710
Plus our captain always said to run
with your tail between your legs

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:58.750
if you think you're gonna lose...

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:01.310
Damn brats think they can mock me!

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:16.390
<i>Our captain is a liar!</i>

00:07:18.600 --> 00:07:26.540
Even he went and fought!
He tried so hard to protect us!

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:29.080
<i>I won't let Kaya-san die!</i>

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:32.250
Alright, then!
Prepare yourselves, Usopp Pirates!

00:07:32.250 --> 00:07:34.520
--Alright!
--Let's fight him!

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:40.650
No! You're still just children!
You mustn't die for my sake!

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:44.730
We're not gonna die.
We're gonna fight to live!

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:48.160
...As our captain always said.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:49.820
--Yeah!
--Yeah!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.070
You brats...

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:09.150
T-that guy...

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:11.880
He broke Captain Kuro's "Cat Claw!"

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:17.950
That leaves only five more
of those weird swords!

00:08:25.700 --> 00:08:27.900
It's okay! He can still fight plenty!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:30.500
Yeah! He still has the other claw!

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.570
Scratch him up
and kill 'im, Captain Kuro!

00:08:33.570 --> 00:08:36.940
Hey! That name is taboo now!

00:08:36.940 --> 00:08:40.650
I think his name in this
village is Klaha... something.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:43.280
<i>Kla-san, then!</i>

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:46.280
<i>--Kla-san! Get 'im!
--Kla-san! Get 'im!</i>

00:08:47.820 --> 00:08:51.820
Be quiet, you!

00:08:54.430 --> 00:09:00.000
I'll come exterminate
every one of you later...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:03.200
Jango too, of course!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.710
W-why us?!

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:09.210
Please stop joking around, Captain Kuro!

00:09:09.210 --> 00:09:12.610
It's still not too late for us
to attack the village, right?!

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:18.890
And if Captain Jango gets her to write
her will, the plan should work!

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:22.220
You need not worry about this plan;

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:28.400
your corpses will be enough for me
to place the blame on you...

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:33.600
I never intended to let you leave
this village from the start...

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:39.710
I can't have people who know
I exist stay alive...

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:40.710
You can't be serious!

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:44.910
Then you planned to kill
us from the very start?!

00:09:46.510 --> 00:09:49.080
That's right...

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:54.590
Since three years ago, when I was
still known as Captain Kuro...

00:09:54.590 --> 00:09:57.190
It was all...

00:09:57.190 --> 00:10:00.180
<i>All part of my plan!</i>

00:10:01.830 --> 00:10:03.860
Man, you guys're dumb.

00:10:03.860 --> 00:10:07.270
You're such an uncool pirate group!

00:10:07.270 --> 00:10:09.100
"Uncool?"

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:14.610
Pirate groups are nothing more than
a collection of social outcasts!

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:17.640
Without plans, what can
they possibly do?!

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:22.650
Every last one should just
shut up and follow my plans!

00:10:22.650 --> 00:10:26.520
Crew members are loyal
pawns of the captain!

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:30.190
Whether my men live or die is all
up to my orders as their leader!

00:10:30.190 --> 00:10:32.690
No matter how powerful the obstacle,

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:38.690
they simply need to stand up
to it and die for my plan...

00:10:53.010 --> 00:10:55.950
This is how pirates are!

00:10:55.950 --> 00:10:59.280
Don't you talk down
to me, traveler boy!

00:11:04.060 --> 00:11:07.830
No matter how many hundreds
or thousands of men follow you

00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:10.830
as their captain...

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:14.200
...you'll never be better than Usopp!

00:11:15.800 --> 00:11:18.210
What?!

00:11:18.210 --> 00:11:22.180
You're saying I'm inferior to a kid
pretending to be a pirate captain?

00:11:22.180 --> 00:11:23.540
That's right!

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:27.550
You're hilarious!

00:11:27.550 --> 00:11:31.890
Don't get cocky just because you
snapped one of my claws!

00:11:31.890 --> 00:11:36.480
How exactly is he better than me?!
Let's hear it!

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.900
Character.

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:44.230
What?!

00:11:44.230 --> 00:11:50.100
You don't know what a true pirate is!

00:12:00.650 --> 00:12:02.280
H-he...

00:12:02.280 --> 00:12:05.650
He kept up with the Pussy
Foot Maneuver's speed!

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:11.280
How insulting...

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:19.670
If you want to know about real
pirates that much, then I'll show you

00:12:19.670 --> 00:12:22.340
that terror...

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:28.500
The terror of a pirate who's been
face to face with death many times!

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:36.280
Hey! That stance! Is he-

00:12:36.280 --> 00:12:38.520
<i>He's gonna use that technique?!</i>

00:12:38.520 --> 00:12:42.660
--But he's only fighting one guy!
--But that's definitely it!

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:47.190
He's planning to use
the Out of the Back Attack!

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:50.300
<i>Isn't it bad for us to be here?!
He'll get us, too!</i>

00:12:50.300 --> 00:12:54.300
He plans to kill us, too!
He even said so earlier!

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:57.370
Please stop, Captain Kuro!
Anything but that technique!

00:12:57.370 --> 00:12:59.240
We'll do anything you want!

00:12:59.240 --> 00:13:02.040
Please, Captain Kuro!

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:04.110
What's the big deal?

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:06.840
He's only wobbling back and forth...

00:13:08.250 --> 00:13:12.740
--Don't do it!
--Captain Kuro!

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:00.890
Please stop, Captain Kuro!

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:02.960
Out of the Back Attack!

00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.580
What a small haul...

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:21.390
<i>I thought they'd have a little
more treasure than that...</i>

00:14:21.390 --> 00:14:26.030
Let's see, is the fight over by now?

00:14:26.030 --> 00:14:30.860
Huh? Everyone's stopped...
Is it over?

00:14:38.710 --> 00:14:40.040
T-there it is!

00:14:41.740 --> 00:14:43.730
Why over there?!

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:47.650
Not again!

00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:50.480
Now it's the wall!

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:58.860
Please stop, Captain Kuro!

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:02.030
It's no use! He attacks at random
using his Pussy Foot Maneuver!

00:15:02.030 --> 00:15:06.470
Because of his speed, not even
he knows what he's cutting!

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:10.040
So many crewmembers have
fallen victim to-

00:15:10.040 --> 00:15:11.230
Hey!

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:21.580
<i>W-what's happening?!
People are suddenly being cut!</i>

00:15:35.930 --> 00:15:39.260
<i>Show yourself, butler...</i>

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:56.510
Who do you take your friends for?!

00:15:59.090 --> 00:16:00.310
Luffy...

00:16:26.210 --> 00:16:28.380
Found you!

00:16:28.380 --> 00:16:32.950
Bastard! You should've let yourself
be cut like a good boy!

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:33.820
Look!

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:39.360
Thanks to you, my adorable men
are left alive and in agony.

00:16:39.360 --> 00:16:43.490
It would've been better for them
to die in that attack!

00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:53.570
Now what? You look like you
have something to say...

00:16:53.570 --> 00:16:55.480
Yeah...

00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:58.140
<i>I will never be...</i>

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:01.380
...a man like you.

00:17:01.380 --> 00:17:03.370
Not "will."

00:17:06.020 --> 00:17:10.350
<i>Someone like you can't be like me!</i>

00:17:19.370 --> 00:17:24.170
Especially since you're
going to die here,

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:29.580
while you writhe in agony as
I hack you up like raw fish...

00:17:30.910 --> 00:17:35.870
I'm going to painstakingly carve
you up as a special treat!

00:17:40.150 --> 00:17:41.790
Oh, no, you don't!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:43.950
Out of the Back Attack!

00:17:55.270 --> 00:17:57.770
Come out, you brats!

00:17:57.770 --> 00:18:02.040
I know you're hiding there!
Give yourself up!

00:18:05.810 --> 00:18:09.380
<i>We surrender!
We'll give you Kaya-san!</i>

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:13.380
Come over here!
We'll take you to her!

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:20.550
Like I'll really fall for that!
I can't trust what a bunch of brats say!

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:23.560
Huh?!

00:18:25.970 --> 00:18:28.460
We got him! Now!

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:34.030
Take this! Pepper Attack!

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:50.590
I knew it! They were... they were
lying from the very start!

00:18:50.590 --> 00:18:52.580
--Push...
--Push...

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:56.590
--Hyaaah!
--Hyaaah!

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:03.660
Oww! Oww! Oww!

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.540
End of the line, hypnotist!

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:18.110
Don't get cocky!

00:19:19.920 --> 00:19:22.460
Darn it! We failed!

00:19:22.460 --> 00:19:27.950
<i>You made a mockery of me.
But I am a pirate...</i>

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:30.700
--Onion!
--Onion!

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:35.760
You pretend pirates have
interfered a bit too much...

00:19:39.410 --> 00:19:41.370
Where are you hiding, Miss?!

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:45.210
I'll start by executing these three.

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:49.250
You can reflect on your foolishness
to meddle in a real pirate fight

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:52.850
in the next life.

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:03.230
There you are.

00:20:03.230 --> 00:20:04.300
No!

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.630
<i>Run, Kaya-san!</i>

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:09.200
Run!

00:20:09.200 --> 00:20:12.410
--Hey!
--Yeah! That's them!

00:20:12.410 --> 00:20:14.740
They're the other way?!

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:17.110
Please stop this!

00:20:17.110 --> 00:20:21.650
Leave them alone!
I'll write my will!

00:20:21.650 --> 00:20:23.280
N-no!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:27.950
<i>You'll be killed if you
write it, Kaya-san!</i>

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.960
I'm sorry...

00:20:31.960 --> 00:20:35.760
Fool. Don't try to make
a deal with me.

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:39.370
<i>Captain Kuro told me
to get rid of everyone.</i>

00:20:39.370 --> 00:20:41.130
You can't be serious!

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:52.780
If you don't do as I say,
then you won't get to kill me!

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:54.450
I won't write my will, either!

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:57.480
H-hold on! Don't act hasty!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:21:01.760
I absolutely must get you
to write that will!

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:04.220
<i>K- Kaya-san!</i>

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:10.500
Alright! I'll let the brats go!

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:14.330
Though they're really
in no condition to run...

00:21:21.410 --> 00:21:22.430
Here!

00:21:25.950 --> 00:21:27.350
Don't forget to sign your name!

00:21:27.350 --> 00:21:29.010
I know...

00:21:32.750 --> 00:21:35.240
D-darn it...

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:41.160
"I leave my entire fortune
to Klahadore, my butler..."

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:44.330
Excellent!
This is your will, all right!

00:21:44.330 --> 00:21:48.130
That saved me the trouble
of hypnotizing you!

00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:53.770
You promise not to kill them, right?

00:21:53.770 --> 00:21:55.340
Don't worry.

00:21:55.340 --> 00:21:59.370
I may not look like it, but I'm
known for being an honest man.

00:22:02.380 --> 00:22:04.370
<i>--Kaya-san!
--Kaya-san!</i>

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:06.650
There they are!

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:10.820
--There they are! There they are! Stop!
--Ouch! Ouch! I've been cut there, you know!

00:22:10.820 --> 00:22:12.260
Over there!

00:22:14.390 --> 00:22:16.960
--Alright, I'll be back!
--Hey!

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:20.270
That's far enough, hypno-freak!

00:22:20.270 --> 00:22:22.700
He followed me here?!

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:32.780
Looks like I better finish this quickly!

00:22:56.140 --> 00:23:06.130
<i>When I was little, I had
a vision of a treasure map</i>

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:17.220
<i>and I always searched
for that miraculous place</i>

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:24.390
<i>before someone else could
beat me to it</i>

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:37.070
<i>If the world is going to change</i>

00:23:38.540 --> 00:23:45.550
<i>before I can even attain my dream</i>

00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:52.630
<i>then take me to the time
when I knew nothing</i>

00:23:52.630 --> 00:24:02.620
<i>so that my memories won't fade</i>
